{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/15/4260128/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中観ていただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさん、七瀬さん、れいかちゃん\nいこたん、松村さん、真夏さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が出てきてくれました！\n誰も出てくれないか、かずみさんだけだと\n思っていたのでびっくり！\nありがたいですね(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)♡\nでも申し訳なさすぎて...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなメンバーと仲がいいんです！\nいこたんの家に行った話もありましたが\nれいかちゃんの家で\nご飯食べたこともあります(^o^)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が贅沢にも5人を振ってしまう形に\nなってしまいましたが\nまたそれぞれ遊んだりできればいいな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインということで\n何作ろうかずっと考えて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔からね、\n人とかぶる物を作りたくなくて\nマカロン、ちんすこう、苺大福とか\nあんまり人が作らない物を作ってきまして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡かりんが作るかりんとう饅頭♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/15/4260128/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/15/4260128/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんな美味しい美味しいと\n食べてくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「買ってきて包んだだけでしょ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて言われましたが\nちゃんと1から作りましたよ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子っぽくマスキングテープで\n止めちゃったりとかして(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/15/4260128/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでもらえてよかった(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏さんのブラウニー美味しかったーー！\nご馳走様でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/15/4260128/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎写メ見て思ったけど、ちょっと痩せましたか( ﾟдﾟ )？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→痩せておりません。太ってもいません。\n現   状   維   持   。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かりんちゃんサッカー部だったっけ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そーだよー！\nそうか。そういう情報も知らない人が\n少しずつ増えているのか。\n改めて自己紹介しようかな。近々。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かりんちゃんは目玉焼きは醤油派？ソース派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→お塩派でございます(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《告知》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break